{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"i\": 1,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"尊严、秩序与克制带来的稳定需要维持，快乐与正在失去的警觉并存，都有 H5–H14 及 M5、M9、M19 的依据，没有新增往事或把音乐变化当成心理原因。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 2,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"从留恋转向急迫、再到疲惫，是将快乐与消逝感并存、反复经历担心与欣喜以及持续加力无法增加把握的既有因果说得更具体，没有改变主线。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 3,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"反复确认无法增加安全感、身体先于念头绷紧的心理过程直接承接 H6、H8、H14 和 M40，且明确说明被追赶是内在感受而非新增的外部事件。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 4,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"把反复追问解释为试图通过重算获得把握、暂时回避不确定性的局部心理过程，接在 H6、H10、H11、H14 和 M1、M40 上，没有将假设性的内心追问写成新的既定往事。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"四条都交代了当下的感受及其心理成因，连起来能读出从重新亲近、害怕失去到身体紧绷和思绪回避的连续过程，时间标记不影响整体理解。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "47917b6b-5714-4871-a8a1-bfdef24e2f7a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T184210365618Z", "elapsed_seconds": 159.516, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T18:44:49.896851+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "0d9bc5247169e9715d78694cfb448e4b04b5617cc3fc13f5f0983252b5583d16", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer